<title>USA: Banyan ends Echo Marketing merger talks.</title>
<headline>Banyan ends Echo Marketing merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>COLORADO SPRINGS, Colo. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banyan Corp said Friday that after extensive due diligence research it had decided to withdraw from merger negotiations with Echo Marketing Corp.</p>
<p>Banyan and Echo entered into merger talks in February.</p>
</text>
